    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Narrabane North, Kilmacow, Co. Waterford\n\nHutchinson Auctioneers are delighted to bring this beautifully presented 2-bedroom detached cottage to the market, ideally situated in the peaceful rural setting of Narrabane North, Kilmacow, while remaining within easy reach of Waterford City, approximately 9.5km away.\n\nExtending to approximately 74.1m², the property is presented in excellent, turn-key condition and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property would make an ideal home for those seeking a peaceful countryside lifestyle while still being conveniently located for access to Waterford City and surrounding areas.\n\nThe entrance hall to this property is well lit and gives a very warm and welcoming feel upon arrival. The accommodation comprises a cosy living room(3.44m x 5.59m) with solid fuel stove, dining room(3.44m x 2.68) with french doors leading to garden, kitchen(3.03 x 4.48m) with solid fuel stove, bedroom 1 (2.41m x 3.26m) bedroom 2(2.38m x 3.25m) and a bathroom(2.90m x 3.30m) with both bath & shower The second bedroom is currently utilised as an office, offering flexibility depending on the purchaser's requirements. Flooring is a mix of traditional terracotta style tiling and original timber flooring which extenuates the cottage style throughout. \n\nExternally, the property benefits from private off-street parking and a generous garden, providing excellent outdoor space and plenty of scope for those with a keen interest in gardening. There is also potential to consider extending the property, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission.\n\nThe property is heated by oil-fired central heating and has been exceptionally well maintained by the current owners. There is also a solid fuel stove in the heart of the property, providing comfort and heat on those cold winter days. Services: Mains water & sewerage to a septic tank.\n\nKey Features:\n\n* Beautifully presented 2-bedroom detached cottage\n* Approximately 74.1m²\n* Turn-key condition\n* Bright and spacious accommodation\n* Oil-fired central heating\n* Solid fuel stove x 2\n* Private off-street parking\n* Generous garden\n* Potential to extend, subject to planning permission\n* Peaceful rural location\n* Approximately 9.5km from Waterford City\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a charming detached home in a peaceful countryside setting, while remaining within convenient commuting distance of Waterford City.\n\nViewing by appointment with Hutchinson Auctioneers today on 051 876923.\n\nDirections Eircode: X91 PV09"
      },
